months before the date on which you use the Software, expressed in United
States dollars.

"Organization" means any company, corporation, partnership, government body,
non-profit, or other legal entity, and any individual acting on its behalf or
for its benefit.

2. Free use for Independent Developers

If you are an Independent Developer, the Licensor grants you a non-exclusive,
