4. Organizations and anyone above the threshold

If you are an Organization, or an individual whose Annual Revenue exceeds
USD 10,000, you may not use the Software beyond the evaluation in section 3
unless you have a commercial license negotiated and signed with the Licensor.

If you were an Independent Developer and stop being one, you have ninety (90)
days to obtain a commercial license or stop using the Software.

To request a commercial license, contact Santiago Almeida:
